        {
            "type":"Label",
            "title":"\n\n1. Making it to a zone is a great feat by itself, but you can complete more tasks in each zone for additional RP:\n - Stay in zone for 0-3min (the RP resets if you enter the zone again without waiting the full time in there)\n - Edging\n - Orgasm\n - Peeing\n - Using Dildo\n - Handcuffed to object\n - Leaving Bra\n - Leaving Panties"
        },
        {
            "type":"Label",
            "title":"\n2. For linked zones, you only get the 'making it to the zone' RP if you visit each of them, also, you can get more RP if you finish the same task in all of the linked zones."
        },
        {
            "type":"Label",
            "title":"\n3. Don't forget to return to the starting zone! If you get home directly, you will not get all the juicy RP you made from the journey.\nYou even have a High Score saved if you cash in all the RP. The Total and High Score values for each zone is displayed too if you enter them, the final multiplied value is shown between ( )."
        },
        {
            "type":"Label",
            "title":"\n4. To make more RP from these tasks there are multipliers you can pursue.\nThese multipliers must be maintained while traveling to the zones and back to the starting zone (near the tree outside). If you think the multipliers don't get updated, know that they only reset at the starting zone!"
        },
